<view class="container">
  <view class="warning-icon">!</view>
  <view class="warning-title">您正在注销账号</view>
  <view class="warning-text">确定要进行此操作吗？</view>

  <view class="account-info">
    <view class="account-label">当前账号：</view>
    <view class="account-phone">{{phone}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-text">
    注销后您的所有数据将被删除且无法恢复，请谨慎操作。
  </view>

  <view class="btn-group">
    <button class="cancel-btn" bindtap="onCancel">取消</button>
    <button class="confirm-btn" bindtap="onConfirm">确定</button>
  </view>
</view>
